        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of such efforts, we offer recycling services to help module owners meet their end-of-life (“EOL”) obligations.",
        "start_character": 38589,
        "end_character": 38707
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001274494-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001274494-26-000021-fad063dbc35c0f72",
        "accession_number": "0001274494-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "First Solar’s approach to responsible solar is interwoven into every aspect of our business and product life cycle, from raw materials sourcing and manufacturing to end-of-life recycling.",
        "start_character": 10208,
        "end_character": 10395
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001274494-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001274494-26-000021-fad063dbc35c0f72",
        "accession_number": "0001274494-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Given the combination of (i) a European market captured by Chinese solar modules, where pricing is at levels near or below manufacturing costs, (ii) an Indian market effectively closed to Southeast Asian products, (iii) a general supply and demand imbalance for Southeast Asian products, and (iv) certain tariffs on modules imported into the United States, we have reduced production of Series 6 modules at our international manufacturing facilities.",
        "start_character": 15424,
        "end_character": 15874
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001274494-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001274494-26-000021-fad063dbc35c0f72",
        "accession_number": "0001274494-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we are in the process of expanding our domestic manufacturing capacity through the construction of our sixth U.S.",
        "start_character": 4431,
        "end_character": 4558
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001274494-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001274494-26-000021-fad063dbc35c0f72",
        "accession_number": "0001274494-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a result of such market opportunities and renewable targets, we recently expanded production of Series 7 modules at our first manufacturing facility in India, bringing our total installed nameplate production capacity in the country to 3.2 GW.",
        "start_character": 20870,
        "end_character": 21116
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001274494-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001274494-26-000021-fad063dbc35c0f72",
        "accession_number": "0001274494-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As part of our global talent management process, we engage in succession planning by prioritizing the development and retention of associates in critical roles.",
        "start_character": 48121,
        "end_character": 48281
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001274494-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001274494-26-000021-fad063dbc35c0f72",
        "accession_number": "0001274494-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As we operate in the U.S.",
        "start_character": 43132,
        "end_character": 43157
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001274494-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001274494-26-000021-fad063dbc35c0f72",
        "accession_number": "0001274494-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Based on publicly available information, we are one of the leaders in R&D investment among PV solar module manufacturers.",
        "start_character": 8459,
        "end_character": 8580
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001274494-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001274494-26-000021-fad063dbc35c0f72",
        "accession_number": "0001274494-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "During 2023, we commenced production of our Series 7TM (“Series 7”) modules at our third manufacturing facility in Ohio and our first manufacturing facility in India, which combine our thin film CdTe technology with a larger form factor and an innovative steel back rail mounting structure that reduces module installation time.",
        "start_character": 3964,
        "end_character": 4292
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001274494-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001274494-26-000021-fad063dbc35c0f72",
        "accession_number": "0001274494-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "During 2024 and 2025, we commenced production of Series 7 modules at our manufacturing facilities in Alabama and Louisiana, respectively.",
        "start_character": 4293,
        "end_character": 4430
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001274494-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001274494-26-000021-fad063dbc35c0f72",
        "accession_number": "0001274494-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In light of such regulatory developments, we have recently commenced or completed certain manufacturing expansion activities in the United States, and we continue to evaluate opportunities for future expansion worldwide, as described below under “Global Markets.” For more information about certain risks associated with the IRA, see Item 1A.",
        "start_character": 14695,
        "end_character": 15037
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001274494-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001274494-26-000021-fad063dbc35c0f72",
        "accession_number": "0001274494-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In light of these market realities, we continue to advocate for industrial and trade policies that provide a level playing field for manufacturers of solar cells and modules.",
